Scenario: Assign account worker contact role to contact via uuid
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to account worker contact roles on accounts via contact uuid.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default worker role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Worker Role                  |
	| Type        | Account Worker                               |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Region       | United States                            |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I assign worker contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles via uuid
	| Default Account Worker Role |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Default Account Worker Role" visible via uuid
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Member" visible via uuid
	And the account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" should be assigned the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the worker contact role "Default Account Worker Role"
	And the account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" should be assigned the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with the worker contact role "Member"

